# Third-party licenses

`pipette-mgmt` links the third-party Rust crates listed below. Their license
terms require that the notices be reproduced when the binary is distributed, so
this file is part of the release artifact.

This file is generated — see `docs/third-party-attribution.md` for how to
regenerate it and when that is required.

Crates offering a choice of license are recorded under the option elected in
`about.toml`, not under every option they offer.

